# Uncomment these types if you want even more clean repository. But be careful.
# It can make harm to an existing project source. Read explanations below.
#
# Resource files are binaries containing manifest, project icon and version info.
# They can not be viewed as text or compared by diff-tools. Consider replacing them with .rc files.
#*.res
#
# Type library file (binary). In old Delphi versions it should be stored.
# Since Delphi 2009 it is produced from .ridl file and can safely be ignored.
#*.tlb
#
# Diagram Portfolio file. Used by the diagram editor up to Delphi 7.
# Uncomment this if you are not using diagrams or use newer Delphi version.
#*.ddp
#
# Visual LiveBindings file. Added in Delphi XE2.
# Uncomment this if you are not using LiveBindings Designer.
#*.vlb
#
# Deployment Manager configuration file for your project. Added in Delphi XE2.
# Uncomment this if it is not mobile development and you do not use remote debug feature.
#*.deployproj
#
# C++ object files produced when C/C++ Output file generation is configured.
# Uncomment this if you are not using external objects (zlib library for example).
#*.obj
#

# Linux/macOS demo executables (no extension) next to the .dpr. Keep this block first:
# its re-include lines would otherwise override every ignore rule above them.
/demo/*/*
!/demo/*/*.*
!/demo/*/*/
# ...except IDE-generated Delphi resources/objects there (model .obj files live
# in subfolders and are not affected)
/demo/*/*.res
/demo/*/*.obj

# Delphi compiler-generated binaries (safe to delete)
*.exe
*.dll
*.bpl
*.bpi
*.dcp
*.so
*.apk
*.drc
*.map
*.dres
*.rsm
*.tds
*.dcu
*.lib
*.a
*.s
*.o
*.ocx

# Delphi autogenerated files (duplicated info)
*.cfg
!build.cfg
*.hpp
*Resource.rc

# Delphi local files (user-specific info)
*.local
*.identcache
*.projdata
*.tvsconfig
*.dsk

# Delphi history and backups
__history/
__recovery/
*.~*
*.bak
*.backup
*.orig
*.tmp

# FPC files
*.ppu
*.rsj
*.compiled
*.dbg
*.lps
*.lrs
backup/

# Castalia statistics file (since XE7 Castalia is distributed with Delphi)
*.stat

# Boss dependency manager vendor folder https://github.com/HashLoad/boss
modules/

/Base/tests/bench_*.txt
/Base/tests/test_results*
/Base/tests/buildtest_results.txt
/Base/tests/out*.txt
/Base/tests/out*/
/Base/tests/bin*/
/Base/tests/units/
/Base/tests/*.res
/Base/work/
/tmp/
/tmp_*.csv
/.codexignore
/.claude/
CLAUDE.local.md
*.zip
robot_in.txt
robot_out.txt
log.txt
*.log
*.old

# Local-only working material (kept out of the repo on purpose)
/manual/*
# ...except the normative chapters: they define the intended behaviour, the code is
# reviewed against them ("the text wins and the code is the thing to fix"), so they
# have to be versioned together with the code they govern.
!/manual/ch18_application_lifecycle.md
!/manual/ch21_resource_system.md
!/manual/engine_signal_inventory.md
!/manual/README.md
/extra/Assimp/

# FPC leftovers and per-demo build output
ppas.bat
ppas.sh
demo/*/_fpc*/
demo/*/_gles/
demo/*/_desktop/
demo/*/lib/
demo/*/_dbg.txt
# FPC linker scripts left in the build directory
link*.res
# output of the CI smoke scripts in tests/
/tests/_engine_smoke/
/tests/_demo_smoke/

# Scratch input/output of the tools in tools/ (ConvertStr etc.)
/tools/test.*
/tools/button.*
/tools/tick.*
/Screenshot_*.png

# engine log folder (created next to the executable)
Logs/
